[{"id":2499811864,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6VABoY","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In general, I agree with this PR: It's good practice to reserve space before adding a bunch of items sequentially, to improve efficiency.\r\n\r\nI think this may have trouble getting merged though since not all of the reserve calls are trivial. There's quite a lot of text to sift through to find whether each of the reserves are correct. Especially, some may be better served with a different approach entirely (in-place allocation, known-length map, etc.).\r\n\r\nIt may be better to see if any of the spots are in particular need of speed up, adding a reserve there, making a small PR, and getting it approved by someone with knowledge of that particular spot of code.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100269#pullrequestreview-2499811864","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100269","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godoten